<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2080185857"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1706297713"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Under"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花鋏キョウ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Horologium Florae"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:18.932"><div begin="00:19.129" end="04:18.932"><p begin="00:19.129" end="00:22.301" itunes:key="L1">なにひとつ未来のことは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕对于未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni hi to tsu mi ra i no ko to ha</span></p><p begin="00:22.302" end="00:25.719" itunes:key="L2">わかりもしないままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍一无所知</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka ri mo shi na i ma ma de</span></p><p begin="00:25.720" end="00:30.838" itunes:key="L3">気持ちさえも伝えられなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至无法传达自己的感受</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mo chi sa e mo tsu ta e ra re na ku te</span></p><p begin="00:32.188" end="00:35.290" itunes:key="L4">空想だと信じたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿坚信这一切皆是幻想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku u so u da to shi n ji ta ku te</span></p><p begin="00:35.291" end="00:38.901" itunes:key="L5">夢だと思いたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要将其当做一场梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me da to o mo i ta ku te</span></p><p begin="00:38.902" end="00:42.673" itunes:key="L6">それでも構わず不条理は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可即便如此种种荒谬之事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo ka ma wa zu fu jo u ri ha</span></p><p begin="00:42.674" end="00:46.002" itunes:key="L7">降り注いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍不断袭来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri so so i da</span></p><p begin="00:47.156" end="00:53.888" itunes:key="L8">ぼくらはずっとずっと 廻り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一直以来都在同个星座之下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ha zu 't to zu 't to ma wa ri tsu du ke ru</span></p><p begin="00:53.889" end="01:08.710" itunes:key="L9">同じ星座の下で 傷つきながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀揣伤痛不断地历经辗转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji se i za no shi ta de ki zu tsu ki na ga ra</span></p><p begin="01:28.653" end="01:35.294" itunes:key="L10">いつもと変わらない笑顔で送り出したんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着一如既往的笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo to ka wa ra na i e ga o de</span></p><p begin="01:35.295" end="01:41.359" itunes:key="L11">(最後かも)なんて言葉を 押し殺しながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许已是最后一次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go ka mo na n te</span></p><p begin="01:42.735" end="01:46.311" itunes:key="L12">こんなにも悲しいなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是早知会如此悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ni mo ka na shi i na ra</span></p><p begin="01:46.312" end="01:49.790" itunes:key="L13">こんなにも苦しいなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是早知会如此痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ni mo ku ru shi i na ra</span></p><p begin="01:49.791" end="01:52.925" itunes:key="L14">最初から君のこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么我宁可自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i sho ka ra ki mi no ko to</span></p><p begin="01:52.926" end="01:54.508" itunes:key="L15">愛さなきゃよかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从来不曾爱上过你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i sa na kya yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:55.591" end="02:02.481" itunes:key="L16">ぼくらはずっとずっと 廻り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一直以来都在同个星座之下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ha zu 't to zu 't to ma wa ri tsu du ke ru</span></p><p begin="02:02.482" end="02:08.874" itunes:key="L17">同じ星座の下で 傷つきながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀揣伤痛不断地历经辗转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji se i za no shi ta de ki zu tsu ki na ga ra</span></p><p begin="02:09.780" end="02:13.196" itunes:key="L18">でも、どうしようもなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是 哪怕感到无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo do u shi yo u mo na ku</span></p><p begin="02:13.197" end="02:16.644" itunes:key="L19">終わることもなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不会让一切结束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ru ko to mo na ku</span></p><p begin="02:16.645" end="02:20.148" itunes:key="L20">君とこうして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因我想与你就此相伴余生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ko u shi te i ki te i ta i n da</span></p><p begin="02:20.149" end="02:25.001" itunes:key="L21">生きていたいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续活下去</span></p><p begin="02:51.346" end="02:58.297" itunes:key="L22">憎しみも何もかも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我默默地许下心愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ku shi mi mo na ni mo ka mo</span></p><p begin="02:58.298" end="03:05.069" itunes:key="L23">洗い流してくれるような<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能将仇恨与这一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra i na ga shi te ku re ru yo u na</span></p><p begin="03:05.070" end="03:16.756" itunes:key="L24">朝が来ますようにと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都洗涤冲刷的清晨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa ga ki ma su yo u ni to</span></p><p begin="03:16.757" end="03:18.401" itunes:key="L25">静かに願った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能够就此到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu ka ni ne ga 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:18.794" end="03:22.202" itunes:key="L26">こんなにも悲しいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明就感到如此悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ni mo ka na shi i no ni</span></p><p begin="03:22.203" end="03:25.604" itunes:key="L27">こんなにも苦しいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明就感到如此痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ni mo ku ru shi i no ni</span></p><p begin="03:25.605" end="03:29.025" itunes:key="L28">どうしても君のこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我不论如何都无法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u shi te mo ki mi no ko to</span></p><p begin="03:29.026" end="03:30.825" itunes:key="L29">愛しているんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让自己停止爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te i ru n da yo</span></p><p begin="03:31.573" end="03:38.233" itunes:key="L30">ぼくらはずっとずっと 廻り続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一直以来都在同个星座之下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ha zu 't to zu 't to ma wa ri tsu du ke ru</span></p><p begin="03:38.234" end="03:44.775" itunes:key="L31">同じ星座の下で 傷つきながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀揣伤痛不断地历经辗转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji se i za no shi ta de ki zu tsu ki na ga ra</span></p><p begin="03:45.626" end="03:49.033" itunes:key="L32">でも、どうしようもなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是 哪怕感到无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo do u shi yo u mo na ku</span></p><p begin="03:49.034" end="03:52.362" itunes:key="L33">終わることもなく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不会让一切结束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ru ko to mo na ku</span></p><p begin="03:52.363" end="03:56.086" itunes:key="L34">君とこうして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因我想与你就此相伴余生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ko u shi te i ki te i ta i n da</span></p><p begin="03:56.087" end="04:18.932" itunes:key="L35">生きていたいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续活下去</span></p></div></body></tt>